{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Urban Grind to Starsand Island - Your Island Paradise Awaits! Tired of the hustle and bustle? Return to the tranquil embrace of\u00a0Starsand Island, a gem hailed as the &quot;Star of the Deep Sea.&quot; Here, immerse yourself in a serene pastoral lifestyle: slow-paced days spent bonding with adorable capybaras, cats, and dogs, savoring the thrill of bountiful fishing, exploring the mystical Moonlit Forest, or simply soaking in the island\u2019s untouched beauty. Leave the mundane behind and rediscover life\u2019s simple joys in this coastal utopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/e45a31a9901c31898660339cedb38c53.avif?t=1767582588\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/25bd314db0eecc2862ecfbdb93c07917.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/25bd314db0eecc2862ecfbdb93c07917.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in Harmony with Nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate tropical fruits and vegetables on your own farm, nurture bonds with charming animals, and design a unique countryside villa tailored to the island\u2019s terrain. Decorate cascading terrace gardens and shape the island\u2019s landscape\u2014every corner invites your creativity and stewardship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/3351b7e23f2793b29833e0397cb4ed40.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/3351b7e23f2793b29833e0397cb4ed40.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/c90a087aa500eddac9a1b65bc2c5e007.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/c90a087aa500eddac9a1b65bc2c5e007.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Roam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrills to Claim Glide on a longboard along pristine coastlines, zip through lush forests on a retro scooter, or sail to uncover neighboring islands\u2019 secrets. With a diverse range of vehicles, embrace the joy of speed\u2014or cruise the iconic coastal highway to witness breathtaking vistas at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6cdb77919df079e3cdbfab9f7908970b.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/6cdb77919df079e3cdbfab9f7908970b.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming Bonds with Islanders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this close-knit community, every resident has a story to tell. Forge lasting friendships through daily interactions and special quests. As connections deepen, you might even find that special someone to share your island life with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/1345f16f4b9f6a3b632001c2b525e871.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/1345f16f4b9f6a3b632001c2b525e871.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Island\u2019s Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into fog-shrouded depths where ancient ruins, rare treasures, and hidden mineral veins await. Master combat skills, and face off against bizarre creatures\u2014each battle promises unexpected surprises and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2966320?t=1767582588","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2966320?t=1767582588","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/1e1a89ad23923ec0432f9483f39a69b23617f686/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767582588","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/1e1a89ad23923ec0432f9483f39a69b23617f686/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767582588","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3864220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>An Island Where Everyone Has a Story \u2013 Starsand Island NPC Affection Trailer Released</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the latest trailer, we would like to show &quot;NPC Affection System&quot; for the first time. This isn't just a simple &quot;likability mechanic&quot; but a dynamic interaction design built around each NPC's unique personality\u2014more like living on a vibrant island, getting to know real people, slowly being understood, and gradually growing closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6bc09026e4712e6d53b92e0d0e86e3b3.webp?t=1767582588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6bc09026e4712e6d53b92e0d0e86e3b3.poster.webp?t=1767582588\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1920 height=1080 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Starsand Island, NPCs' emotions shift based on your actions. They'll light up when you remember their preferences, or even pout a little if you've been absent too long. These aren't scripted events but organic, subtle changes in your relationships. You think you're observing them, but they're quietly watching you too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/2ac91f92d1ecef601e067649ad714356.webp?t=1767582588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/2ac91f92d1ecef601e067649ad714356.poster.webp?t=1767582588\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1920 height=1080 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real charm? Affection isn't one-sided. As the game progresses, some NPCs will extend kindness on their own\u2014maybe even do something silly just for you. From shifts in conversation tone to giving you personalized gifts, waiting for you by the shore, or wishing upon a star with you in mind\u2026 every detail stems from the bond you've built. As shown in the trailer, players gradually uncover Pastelle's unwavering love for animals, help repair her farm equipment, and help her cope with grief over a lost pet. Along the way, she develops her own intimate relations with you. So &quot;romance&quot; isn't just about pursuing NPCs; sometimes, they might be the ones quietly pursuing you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/e246f5efa816449d2caecb747b2f0222.webp?t=1767582588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/e246f5efa816449d2caecb747b2f0222.poster.webp?t=1767582588\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1920 height=1080 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each NPC's affection path is unique, with intertwined storylines\u2014romantic, professional, or otherwise. Your decisions matter: the gifts you give, who you spend holidays with, and how you interact will shape their future. Keep an eye out for surprises\u2014whether in chance weather encounters or special events. You might even wake up to an unexpected morning invitation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/878be59e8a4ebfa4bedc27caadecba0c.webp?t=1767582588\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/878be59e8a4ebfa4bedc27caadecba0c.poster.webp?t=1767582588\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1920 height=1080 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The NPCs of Starsand Island aren't just backdrop; they're part of your life on the island. They grow, change, and, when you least expect it, carve a place in your heart, just like the trailer says:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this island, every islander has a story to tell. Every moment spent together becomes a treasured memory. And your story begins here.</p></p><br><h1>Thank You for Your Support at Galaxies Games Showcase! Kickstarter Pre-Launch is Live</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dear players,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re back from the <i>2025 Galaxies Games Showcase</i> and truly grateful for all the feedback, encouragement, and excitement we received from everyone we met!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights of the Week:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Milestone:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Steam wishlist has increased by 30,000 in just one week\u2014thank you for supporting us and helping our dream come true!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Features Incoming:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly requested features like the Mount System are now in development. Stay tuned for updates in our upcoming devlogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/ff3b1f6b42d2618b9a7e5bc7e8540e2f.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/ff3b1f6b42d2618b9a7e5bc7e8540e2f.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/ff3b1f6b42d2618b9a7e5bc7e8540e2f.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/a1d6e3025cfbef31d577d8cdfdfc734f.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/a1d6e3025cfbef31d577d8cdfdfc734f.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/a1d6e3025cfbef31d577d8cdfdfc734f.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kickstarter Coming Soon:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Kickstarter campaign will officially launch in April 29th! Please follow the pre-launch pagr so you don\u2019t miss the launch next week. Every follow and share makes a huge difference to our campaign!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who visited us, supported us online, or gave suggestions. With your help, we\u2019ll keep moving forward and bring you more surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/a0cf810434f4f3d2efcce80b5cbaa4e5.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/a0cf810434f4f3d2efcce80b5cbaa4e5.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/a0cf810434f4f3d2efcce80b5cbaa4e5.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 The Dev Team</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Urban Grind to Starsand Island - Your Island Paradise Awaits! Tired of the hustle and bustle? Return to the tranquil embrace of\u00a0Starsand Island, a gem hailed as the &quot;Star of the Deep Sea.&quot; Here, immerse yourself in a serene pastoral lifestyle: slow-paced days spent bonding with adorable capybaras, cats, and dogs, savoring the thrill of bountiful fishing, exploring the mystical Moonlit Forest, or simply soaking in the island\u2019s untouched beauty. Leave the mundane behind and rediscover life\u2019s simple joys in this coastal utopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/e45a31a9901c31898660339cedb38c53.avif?t=1767582588\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/25bd314db0eecc2862ecfbdb93c07917.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/25bd314db0eecc2862ecfbdb93c07917.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in Harmony with Nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate tropical fruits and vegetables on your own farm, nurture bonds with charming animals, and design a unique countryside villa tailored to the island\u2019s terrain. Decorate cascading terrace gardens and shape the island\u2019s landscape\u2014every corner invites your creativity and stewardship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/3351b7e23f2793b29833e0397cb4ed40.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/3351b7e23f2793b29833e0397cb4ed40.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/03b78dfc5d626a687669134d714114da.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ccd1f009a8035f6d4aab9786e01231e.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/c90a087aa500eddac9a1b65bc2c5e007.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/c90a087aa500eddac9a1b65bc2c5e007.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom to Roam</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrills to Claim Glide on a longboard along pristine coastlines, zip through lush forests on a retro scooter, or sail to uncover neighboring islands\u2019 secrets. With a diverse range of vehicles, embrace the joy of speed\u2014or cruise the iconic coastal highway to witness breathtaking vistas at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/5ae17b09c7959e42e219f0ffb7b4f472.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6cdb77919df079e3cdbfab9f7908970b.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/6cdb77919df079e3cdbfab9f7908970b.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartwarming Bonds with Islanders</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this close-knit community, every resident has a story to tell. Forge lasting friendships through daily interactions and special quests. As connections deepen, you might even find that special someone to share your island life with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/784c1a3edff8e9063523e575e6310dc5.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/1345f16f4b9f6a3b632001c2b525e871.avif?t=1767582588\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras_big/1345f16f4b9f6a3b632001c2b525e871.avif?t=1767582588 width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Island\u2019s Mysteries</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into fog-shrouded depths where ancient ruins, rare treasures, and hidden mineral veins await. Master combat skills, and face off against bizarre creatures\u2014each battle promises unexpected surprises and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.poster.avif?t=1767582588\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.webm?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/extras/6c873589f889ad674e93775018f6c2d6.mp4?t=1767582588\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Seed Lab"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966320/2e82370bf60a42fc82c5082e7b3b94575abf8ed1/header.jpg?t=1767582588","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966320/868041636/deedaee74e984b6d25b9934601247550bebd1493/1765015353/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765016574","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966320/868041636/deedaee74e984b6d25b9934601247550bebd1493/1765015353/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765016574","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966320/868041636/deedaee74e984b6d25b9934601247550bebd1493/1765015353/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765016574","id":257244421,"name":"Four Seasons-EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257244421/04d593c74eafac4878cbfc2c1671f87aa0fd4198/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765016574"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2966320/725967178/6b11e0aac58a5c928d0231da2960d935b7338a7